    "modid": "zombie_infection",
    "modName": "Zombie Infection",
    "version": "1.0.3",
    "description": "Zombies that kill players without a weapon, will instead infect the player.. causing them to become a Zombie, they can either die or cure themseleves to remove the infection however they can also spread the infection to other players.",
